This product includes work derived from two earlier harnesses built
independently against the same brief, and reimplemented here under this
project's own contracts:

  - a process layer (state machine, provenance ledger, human approval gate,
    research ledger with citation integrity)
  - an artifact layer (the manifest / spec / task triad, DAG acyclicity
    checking, the cold-dispatch model)

It integrates, but does not vendor, the L.S.Design suite and its studio
(github.com/verbalogicproject-creator/L.S.Design), which remain separately
licensed by their author.
